<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-C.BANK OKAYS LATVIJAS KAPITAL-BANKA OFFICES.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-C.BANK OKAYS LATVIJAS KAPITAL-BANKA OFFICES.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Friday said it has allowed Latvijas kapital-banka to open representative offices in Budapest and Kiev.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that now eight Latvian banks have around 20 offices abroad.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
